docs {
  # VULN-02: Regular Expression Denial of Service (ReDoS)
  
  ## Objective:
  Demonstrate injection of catastrophic nested quantifier regex pattern `((a+)+)+$` into MongoDB `$regex` query, causing CPU resource exhaustion.
  
  ## Expected Result:
  Before fix: The query takes a significant amount of CPU or is executed directly as a raw regex against all text fields.
}
